---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 bg-white" aria-labelledby="network-heading">
  <div class="container-main">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="section-label justify-center">
        <span class="h-px w-8 bg-brand-500"></span>
        Service Availability
        <span class="h-px w-8 bg-brand-500"></span>
      </span>
      <h2 id="network-heading" class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Check Support For Your <span class="text-gradient">Location And Model</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-lg">
        Service coverage, response time, spare-part availability, and the party responsible for site visits can vary by location, inverter model, seller, and installation contract. Ask Qbits or your authorised seller to confirm those details in writing before purchase.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-4xl gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600">Before purchase</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Confirm the service contact</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Record who handles commissioning, fault diagnosis, removal, shipping, and reinstallation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600">For your model</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Request written terms</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Obtain the current warranty document, registration steps, exclusions, remedy, and response process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 p-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600">For your site</p>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Verify local availability</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Share your PIN code and installation details so the current support route can be checked.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn-primary">Check Service Availability</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
